{"term":{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0001135","compactId":"SO_0001135","id":"SO:0001135","label":"beta_turn_left_handed_type_two","definition":{"text":"Left handed type II: A motif of four consecutive residues that may contain one H-bond, which, if present, is between the main-chain CO of the first residue and the main-chain NH of the fourth. It is characterized by the dihedral angles: Residue(i+1): -140 degrees > phi > -20 degrees, +80 degrees > psi > +180 degrees. Residue(i+2): +20 degrees > phi > +140 degrees, -40 degrees > psi > +90 degrees.","xrefs":["EBIBS:GAR","http://www.ebi.ac.uk/msd-srv/msdmotif/"]},"comments":[],"synonyms":[{"scope":"exact","value":"beta turn left handed type two"},{"scope":"exact","value":"beta_turn_iil"},{"scope":"exact","value":"type II' beta turn"},{"scope":"exact","value":"type II' turn"}],"xrefs":[],"subsets":["biosapiens"],"altIds":["BS:00213"],"namespace":"sequence","isObsolete":false,"replacedBy":[],"canonicalUrl":"/browser/current_release/term/SO:0001135/","history":{"firstSeen":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]},"mostRecent":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]},"entries":[{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]}],"semanticEvents":[{"type":"created","date":"2016-12-05","commit":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","subject":"Add renamed SO files","summary":"Term introduced into the editable ontology history","details":["Initial label: beta_turn_left_handed_type_two","Initial definition captured.","Initial parent: SO:0001133"],"issueRefs":[]}]},"parents":["SO:0001133"],"children":[],"ancestors":["SO:0001133","SO:0001128","SO:0001078","SO:0001070","SO:0000839","SO:0001411","SO:000000